{"about_the_game":"Pro Wrestling Sim is a text-based pro-wrestling booking simulator. Control a wrestling promotion, decide your roster, and create storylines, feuds and matches where the winners and losers are in your hands.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><strong>Promises</strong><br>Your workers will request that you make promises to them. This can be asking for a match with a worker, asking for a title shot, or even a title win. Agree to make a promise and you better deliver - you don't want to upset your top star or his friends!<br><br><strong>Edit Database</strong><br>With the Edit Database functionality, you can design, build and grow a world of your own creation, based on reality or your own imagination, and share it with friends.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"6879b0750c07251117748a144355a120cad30178.jpg","localized_name":"Five Star Classic","name":"Five Star Classic","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1157700/6879b0750c07251117748a144355a120cad30178.jpg"},{"icon":"23412e5f67d306fa613b3f9ef7d152dd4d8a68b2.jpg","localized_name":"DUD","name":"DUD","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1157700/23412e5f67d306fa613b3f9ef7d152dd4d8a68b2.jpg"},{"icon":"39ff2c44d47b21f2cd9498227b32326f0945f4fa.jpg","localized_name":"Negative. Five. Stars. ","name":"Negative. Five. Stars. ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1157700/39ff2c44d47b21f2cd9498227b32326f0945f4fa.jpg"},{"icon":"a8a3e734e1d11eeeab9a1de3ff1e81a166c7cd9d.jpg","localized_name":"Backyard Brawler","name":"Backyard Brawler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1157700/a8a3e734e1d11eeeab9a1de3ff1e81a166c7cd9d.jpg"},{"icon":"683e9dbdd88e0699dbc8843f85173d0f4fffdd06.jpg","localized_name":"Regional Wrasslin","name":"Regional Wrasslin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1157700/683e9dbdd88e0699dbc8843f851